---
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Cost & Spend Tracking" currentPath="/docs/guides/cost-spend-tracking">
  <div class="space-y-8 font-mono text-xs">
    <div>
      <div class="text-[11px] text-purple-400 font-semibold mb-1">FINANCIAL OBSERVABILITY</div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-sans">Cost, Quota & Spend Tracking</h1>
      <p class="text-[#8f96a3] text-sm font-sans mt-1">Multi-dimension spend breakdown, spend caps, and token savings.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-[#121622] border border-[#222738] space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-sans">Transparent Routing Headers</h2>
      <p class="text-[#8f96a3] leading-relaxed">
        Every chat completion response includes detailed billing and routing provenance headers:
      </p>
      <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#181d2c] border border-[#262f44] text-[#a0a8be] space-y-1">
        <div><span class="text-purple-300">X-RouteNex-Request-Id:</span> req_01HP8A...</div>
        <div><span class="text-purple-300">X-RouteNex-Selected-Provider:</span> groq</div>
        <div><span class="text-purple-300">X-RouteNex-Selected-Model:</span> groq/llama-3.3-70b-versatile</div>
        <div><span class="text-purple-300">X-RouteNex-Tokens-Saved:</span> 142</div>
        <div><span class="text-purple-300">X-RouteNex-Estimated-Cost-USD:</span> 0.000000</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
